flowchart TB
  Submit[Enquiry with submission key] --> Validate[Validate and control abuse]
  Validate --> Commit[Firestore transaction saves enquiry key and task]
  Commit --> Receipt[Return stored receipt]
  Commit --> Claim[Worker claims durable task]
  Claim --> Send[Call email adapter with timeout]
  Send --> State[Record delivery or bounded retry]
  State --> Ops[Operator status and alerts]
  Sweep[Scheduled recovery sweep] --> Claim
